  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project for the Establishment and Capacity Building of ICU(Intensive Care Unit) in Medical City, Baghdad, Rep. of Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICU construction. Equipment support upon demand. On-the-spot training(capacity enhancement). Dispatch of skilled personnel. Project oversight</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
